# skills: a raised stat lasts the battle and no longer. Jian (made strong with cheats_strong so the battle
# ends quickly) and Rufus (party_rufus), Rufus at level 1 (level index 0 pinned), first temple battle.
# Round 1: Jian Fights, Rufus casts Rally on himself (picker Right): his ATK stage (record 1 + 0x40) 0 -> 1
# and his ATK 99 -> 123. Then A is pressed until the battle is won and the result screens are gone; the
# stage stays 1 to the end of the battle (shot nb_won). A second battle is then forced from the field (the
# three writes enemy_force.plan uses): at its first command prompt the stage is 0 and his ATK 99 again
# (peeks stage_next_battle, atk_next_battle; shot nb_second). Battle records at 0x0228E860 in both
# battles (peeked). Run with --save.
include party_rufus
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B47D4 0
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x84 50
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e8e4 rufus_mp
watch u16 0x0228e90c rufus_atk_stage
watch u32 0x0228e8f0 rufus_atk
watch u32 0x020B0010 main_state
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 30
wait 300
shot nb_cast
